img{width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:10px;object-fit:cover;background:var(--border);flex-shrink:0}</style></head><body><div class='date'>Mar 13 Friday</div><h4>Friday night briefing</h4><div class='subtitle'>Iran war escalates, Saudi oil cut 20%, and your game scoring overhaul just shipped</div><p class='msg'>Three world events intersecting with a productive sprint on your side.</p><hr class='divider'><div class='story'><div class='story-text'><div class='story-headline'>Saudi Arabia cuts oil output 20% after Hormuz blockade</div><div class='story-summary'>Safaniya and Zuluf offshore fields shut down. Production dropped from 10.9M to ~8M bpd. IEA says Gulf-wide losses exceed 10M bpd. Iran warns of $200/bbl oil.</div><div class='story-meta'><span class='story-category'>Energy</span><span>· Reuters</span></div></div><img class='story-img' src='https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518709766631-a6a7f45921c3?w=160&h=160&fit=crop' alt='Oil platform' onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"></div><hr class='divider'><div class='story'><div class='story-text'><div class='story-headline'>Turkey intercepts third Iranian ballistic missile near Incirlik</div><div class='story-summary'>NATO air defenses engaged the missile over Turkish airspace. Sirens sounded at Incirlik Air Base. 5,000 US Marines deploying to the Gulf. 58 injured in northern Israel strike.</div><div class='story-meta'><span class='story-category'>Conflict</span><span>· WSJ / Forbes</span></div></div><img class='story-img' src='https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1580752300992-559f8e0734e0?w=160&h=160&fit=crop' alt='Military' onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"></div><hr class='divider'><div class='story'><div class='story-text'><div class='story-headline'>Game scoring overhaul shipped — S-tier now empty by design</div><div class='story-summary'>New 10-dimension /100 system with hover breakdowns live. Dungeon Crawl and 6 others lead at 88. Zero S-tier until playtested. Your task-factory article is in the critique pipeline.</div><div class='story-meta'><span class='story-category'>Your projects</span><span>· Tonight</span></div></div><img class='story-img' src='https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555949963-aa79dcee981c?w=160&h=160&fit=crop' alt='Code scoring' onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"></div></body></html>"},"priority":"medium","state":"active","subType":"briefing","subtitle":"Iran war escalates, Saudi oil cut 20%, and your game scoring overhaul just shipped","timestamp":"2026-03-13T23:51:00Z","title":"Friday night briefing","type":"html-webview"}
