ar(--muted);line-height:1.5;margin:14px 0 0;padding:12px;background:var(--surface);border-radius:10px}</style></head><body><h4>March’s AI model avalanche</h4><div class='subtitle'>12+ major releases in one week — GPT-5.4, DeepSeek V3.2, Gemini 2.5 Pro</div><p class='msg'>The first week of March 2026 was the most concentrated burst of AI releases in memory. Here’s what shipped and what it means.</p><hr class='divider'><div class='model'><div class='model-info'><div class='model-name'>GPT-5.4</div><div class='model-detail'>1M context · native computer use · 83% GDPval</div></div><span class='model-badge badge-new'>Mar 5</span></div><hr class='divider'><div class='model'><div class='model-info'><div class='model-name'>DeepSeek V3.2</div><div class='model-detail'>$0.28/M input · chat + reasoning unified</div></div><span class='model-badge badge-price'>90% cheaper</span></div><hr class='divider'><div class='model'><div class='model-info'><div class='model-name'>Gemini 2.5 Pro</div><div class='model-detail'>2M token context · longest in market</div></div><span class='model-badge badge-new'>Google</span></div><hr class='divider'><div class='model'><div class='model-info'><div class='model-name'>Claude 4 / Opus 4.6</div><div class='model-detail'>Best reasoning + writing · Claude Code CLI</div></div><span class='model-badge badge-new'>Anthropic</span></div><div class='note'>OpenAI, Alibaba, Lightricks, Tencent, Meta, ByteDance, and multiple universities all released within seven days. The pricing race is compressing: DeepSeek’s output token is 24× cheaper than GPT-5.4’s.</div></body></html>"},"priority":"medium","state":"active","subType":"insight","subtitle":"12+ major releases in one week — GPT-5.4, DeepSeek V3.2, Gemini 2.5 Pro","timestamp":"2026-03-13T23:51:00Z","title":"March’s AI model avalanche","type":"html-webview"}
